---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = '6 June 2026';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — Latentsig AI" description="Terms of Service for Latentsig AI.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-grid-pattern">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface/40 via-surface/70 to-surface"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-24">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-4xl">
        <span class="text-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl-mobile md:text-headline-xl text-on-surface leading-tight">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant tracking-widest uppercase">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop flex flex-col gap-12">
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
        These terms govern your use of latentsig.com, operated by Latentsig Software Private Limited
        ("Latentsig AI", "we", "us"). By using this website you accept these terms.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">1. Use of this website</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          This website provides information about our consulting, R&amp;D advisory, and
          implementation services. You may browse and link to it freely. You may not attempt to
          disrupt the site or misrepresent its content as your own.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">2. Content, not advice</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Content on this site — including any insights, articles, or technical material — is
          provided for general information. It is not professional, legal, or engineering advice
          for your specific situation, and we may update or remove it at any time. Professional
          advice is provided only under a signed engagement agreement.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">3. Client engagements</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Consulting and engineering services are governed by separate written agreements with each
          client. Nothing on this website constitutes an offer, quotation, or commitment to deliver
          services, and these terms do not modify any engagement agreement.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">4. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          The Latentsig AI name, logo, and the content of this website are owned by us unless
          otherwise noted. You may quote brief excerpts with attribution; reproduction of
          substantial portions requires our written permission.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">5. Disclaimer and liability</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          This website is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. To the maximum extent
          permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss arising from your use of, or reliance
          on, this website or its content. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be
          limited under applicable law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">6. Governing law</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes arising from your use of this
          website are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Bengaluru, India.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">7. Changes</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          We may revise these terms from time to time. The date above reflects the latest version;
          continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Questions about these terms:
          <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:latentsig@gmail.com">latentsig@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
